UnitPriorityFeeMevTaxModule::constructor
├── when the initial owner is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with OwnableInvalidOwner
└── when deploying a valid contract
    ├── it should set the owner
    ├── it should set the priority fee multiplier
    ├── it should set the min threshold
    ├── it should set the base fee factor
    ├── it should emit MultiplierSet
    ├── it should emit MinThresholdSet
    └── it should emit BaseFeeFactorSet

UnitPriorityFeeMevTaxModule::setMultiplier
├── when the caller is not the owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── when the caller is the owner
    ├── it should set the priority fee multiplier
    └── it should emit MultiplierSet

UnitPriorityFeeMevTaxModule::setMinThreshold
├── when the caller is not the owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── when the caller is the owner
    ├── it should set the min threshold
    └── it should emit MinThresholdSet

UnitPriorityFeeMevTaxModule::setBaseFeeFactor
├── when the caller is not the owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── when the caller is the owner
    ├── it should set the base fee factor
    └── it should emit BaseFeeFactorSet
